]]></description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 01:30:13 +0000</pubDate><link>https://huggingface.co/destined/hurston-1</link><dc:creator>Gcarter08</dc:creator><comments>https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50227330</comments><guid isPermaLink="false">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50227330</guid></item></channel></rss>